{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd1a <i>A Fascinating Story 2</i> Demo Description \ud83e\udd1a</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the captivating world of <i>Zhang Wei 2</i>, dive into this thrilling demo!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on &quot;Sleep Together&quot; in the female character's home to enter the CG interface!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning Visual Feast: Explore 3 unique pose CGs carefully designed for a certain female character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exciting Strategic Missions: Tackle 3 captivating missions blending strategy and narrative</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any feedback can be shared in the community or groups, and we\u2019ll carefully review it all. Thank you for trying the demo! Stay tuned for future demo updates</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427110/extras/49802824a9b0e448a26ea0034e4f774d.avif?t=1761891972\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc96Story Introduction\ud83d\udc96</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427110/extras/258875043f4e908ee909d63b747dbf73.poster.avif?t=1761891972\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427110/extras/258875043f4e908ee909d63b747dbf73.webm?t=1761891972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427110/extras/258875043f4e908ee909d63b747dbf73.mp4?t=1761891972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will once again take on the role of the protagonist, Zhang Wei, embarking on romantic encounters with multiple beautiful women across various storylines. Balance work and romance while managing your time wisely\u2014time is money! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Fascinating Story 2 is an adult visual novel game focused on romancing and developing relationships with beautiful characters. Complete their missions to win their favor! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude11<span class=\"bb_strike\">Being a domineering CEO isn't that easy</span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf77Game Features\ud83c\udf77</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427110/extras/cedfc7d64f1023f674d4ec0db8b03646.poster.avif?t=1761891972\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427110/extras/cedfc7d64f1023f674d4ec0db8b03646.webm?t=1761891972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427110/extras/cedfc7d64f1023f674d4ec0db8b03646.mp4?t=1761891972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427110/extras/38b159d18d599d8039880bbc1d76aed5.poster.avif?t=1761891972\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427110/extras/38b159d18d599d8039880bbc1d76aed5.webm?t=1761891972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427110/extras/38b159d18d599d8039880bbc1d76aed5.mp4?t=1761891972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427110/extras/446fba34242761ed